<title>PORTUGAL: Four killed in blast at Portuguese fireworks plant.</title>
<headline>Four killed in blast at Portuguese fireworks plant.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four youths died on Tuesday in an explosion at a fireworks factory in northern Portugal, fire brigade officials said.</p>
<p>The cause of the explosion at Fornos de Algodres, about 400 km (250 miles) northeast of Lisbon, was not immediately known.</p>
</text>
